{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "1b69779c78209fc6d3fad6fedcd9861575203ba4d10252baae46d27a63be5f97", "ja": "支配者たちは囁く", "zh": "统治者们低语着", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "15d1f328a9e0197a95e35ad96ea8670aeb17c74841b390c5f5d0d0a0fb4e292a", "ja": "暁陽アカデミア生徒会長・のり子の元へと、\n煌聖リーガルカレッジ副生徒会長・このみが\nやってくる。語るのは武装集団『セクター・\nゼロ』について。一方やよい達は、歩の先導\nで、見知らぬ街にたどり着く……。", "zh": "暁陽学院学生会长・のり子处，\n煌圣利格尔学院副学生会长・このみ\n登门拜访。话题指向武装集团\"零区\"。\n另一边，やよい等人在歩的带领下，\n来到了一座陌生的城市……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "86bdc994b21729bd107942ec62e3975de91537a5cb1e873efa4bc0e435c7db57", "ja": "―暁陽アカデミア、生徒会室―", "zh": "——晓阳学园，学生会室——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1001_se", "source_sha256": "6907ffc671b7b19e5de19878342be24d5b93d6f8fbb33690337a9179a8d63b7e", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャッ！", "zh": "咚咚，咔哒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "f9dfb726b1311fc332d771889f99fcd087d9aa070b539ded0ed6d1ba420533ae", "ja": "はぁい、のり子ちゃん♪　お邪魔するわよ。\nもちろん、人払いはしてくれたわよね？", "zh": "好——，诺莉子♪我进来打扰啦。\n当然已经支开其他人了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "5c039e05fee66ca3904f084a00efb37a7763db589a2baa1f99c60e8e6daebbdc", "ja": "当たり前でしょ、お互い秘密の多い立場なんだし。\n……で？　ウチの学都で、大捕り物やったんだって？", "zh": "那是当然啦，毕竟我们双方都有很多秘密嘛。\n……然后呢？听说你在我们的学都里，搞了场大抓捕？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "fd15a8c6236026fd2aa5b28f0d8c980b45f08b99b579a4c76f2db1e66db59012", "ja": "そうなの、『セクター・ゼロ』のテストも兼ねてね！\n初めての大規模作戦にしては、上出来だったわ♪", "zh": "没错，这是为了测试“Sector Zero”嘛！\n第一次进行大规模行动，就已经完成得相当出色了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "82691e8099098e3c90abd35a2fb02a7d467471583ff36db143c9a663a4809daf", "ja": "あなたのところの真ちゃんが、大活躍してくれたの！\nあの子うちに欲しいわ、お世辞抜きで。", "zh": "你那边的真可是大显身手了呢！\n不夸张地说，我都想把她挖到我们这儿来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "cad5907223465bdcd2d2e8271e3d2d10d9d2ed310871275cafb438f240338d26", "ja": "あげないよ！　エースなんだから。\nってことは、『反忘却同盟』のメンバーも捕まえた？", "zh": "不给你！她可是王牌。\n这么说来，『反遗忘同盟』的成员也抓到了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "5cb72bc438cdf165bca49156cc08e5a403b61f2142eda5c25941c89b2b008f52", "ja": "いいえ、さすがに手強いわね……\n下部組織のメンバーが何人か網に掛かったくらい。", "zh": "不，确实很棘手呢……\n也就抓到了几个下属组织的成员。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "56de3aae413ce4a64b470f22c2feb04492a926bb7074c354b9aa0719e4d2f098", "ja": "でも、手ごたえはあったわ。\n次はもっと、上手にやってみせるわよ。", "zh": "不过，还是有收获的。\n下次我会做得更好给你看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "d9f56ba2f2471be0f1c3d3e36c6371df4574ff5ee1eaf27416e0488f93bc357e", "ja": "それなら、なによりだけど……\nうちも慈善事業じゃないんだけどね？　このみさん。", "zh": "那样的话就再好不过了……不过，我们这边也不是做慈善的哦？木实小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "ceff7fb01123f6a8964e410c127cb1e2470af2ad0ce66bc76dace9fb4f060069", "ja": "わかってるって、『陰界の王』の捜索でしょ？\nそっちもちゃんと進めておくわ。", "zh": "我知道啦，是寻找“阴界之王”对吧？\n那件事我也会好好推进的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "e6d695e7662ba433da182e2d8245a6029451dd2430bcdefcb665cdb41bc56128", "ja": "でも意外ね～、あなたってもしかして、\n結構臆病なのかしら？　ウフフ。", "zh": "不过还真是意外呢～你该不会，其实挺胆小的吧？　呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "c8a0bb7ae260352ec4ed2c5cfbfd21c5992fb69e4cc1dd13e53f92a85817d419", "ja": "そこは慎重って言ってほしいな～。\nなにこのみさん、煽ってる？　場外乱闘はしないよ。", "zh": "这时候就请说我谨慎嘛～  \n怎么，大神小姐，你是在挑衅我吗？我可不会打场外乱斗哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "f4dec413099f6aea490d4f4cf83069e0da4f98bbf71cf8b532d762855078b295", "ja": "まさか！　不思議なだけよ。あなたはまぎれもなく、\nこの陽界の王だわ。権力も、実力も。", "zh": "怎么会！只是觉得不可思议罢了。你毫无疑问\n是这阳界之王。不论是权力，还是实力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "b6b8eef449d1ecaf5571ddd1449ccce6f4d42e3a8065eac4dab726bfcd434998", "ja": "あなたの王国を脅かす者なんていない。なのに、\n『陰界の王』なんておとぎ話を気にするなんてね。", "zh": "没有任何人能威胁到您的王国。明明如此，却还会在意什么“阴界之王”的童话，真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "0fdbf16c6667333cc121f757c792e8bafd2ed3ced14918f530ff99f4beb6d092", "ja": "「夢と現の交わりし時、陰なる王は御座へと還り、\nよろずの事は塵へと還らん」……だったかしら。", "zh": "“梦境与现实交汇之际，幽邃之王将重返王座，\n万事万物皆归于尘土”……好像是这么说的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "7f6c696ca580a8c83a73e9cb859f34c16a5b4a7faa925dd491640462da13ae78", "ja": "まあ、いちレスラーとしての興味、ってのも\nあるんだけど……今のアタシは暁陽のボスだからさ。", "zh": "哎，虽然作为一名摔跤手，我也有点\n好奇就是了……但现在的我可是晓阳的老大啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "f5d4df2707af7570e32dc2f57f7288d80bd31add849518ee4364ce67226c2e71", "ja": "守らなきゃならないものが多いんだよね。\n災いの芽は摘んでおかなきゃ。どんなに小さくても。", "zh": "必须要守护的东西太多了。\n灾祸的萌芽必须提前掐掉。哪怕再微小也一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "1bdda94d8f8dfd646d5da6153f1b83ad51cddec8f60b90f210a1d6b26bee90a0", "ja": "そこはお互い様ってことね……いいわ、\nこれからも、仲良くやっていきましょ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "在这点上，我们彼此彼此呢……好吧，今后也好好相处吧？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1020_se", "source_sha256": "ac4a5c179f7643c84746531197c11f45f708fec86716b80cc71e5a2f10724052", "ja": "バシャ、バシャ、バシャ……", "zh": "哗啦、哗啦、哗啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1021_005yay", "source_sha256": "15cb68e20ae618d29476035164641741d6b52ba1f3b95f0103ab09f435c75056", "ja": "あのー……これって、どこまで行くんですか？\nもう追って来てないみたいですけど。", "zh": "那个……我们这是要去哪儿啊？好像他们已经不追来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1022_001har", "source_sha256": "be6140d3d923fb7a8251557845e6bf8bf3bfaa93bfbcd2a2c6e9cae37d9cb166", "ja": "あの人たち、機動風紀委員だったのかな？\n事情を説明して、保護を求めた方がいいのかも……？", "zh": "那些人，难道是机动风纪委员吗？\n是不是把情况解释清楚，向他们寻求保护会比较好呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "564868292251c19412172d22fd0abf4d6a27f00103a8c9ddca841e42a6478f82", "ja": "うーん、それはオススメできないかな。\nあいつらは『セクター・ゼロ』って言ってさ……", "zh": "嗯……我不太建议那样做。\n那些家伙自称“零号区域”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1ad7f4780cf96aa5cc1c06c8bfbce2360edd61f6e693c24da6b27a326f9cc2cb", "ja": "一応、機動風紀委員の一部署ってことになってるけど、\nほとんど別物だよ。あいつら、全然容赦ない。", "zh": "名义上算是机动风纪委员会的一个部门，\n但实际上几乎是完全不同的东西。他们可是毫不留情的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "2d262a97c51272526e758c645e2046cdfc2a0eeadf958734ab48e608461e0a35", "ja": "一般の生徒も平気で捕まえて、更生施設に\nブチ込むってウワサ。マイガー！だよ、ホントに。", "zh": "听说连普通学生也会毫不留情地抓起来，扔进矫正设施。天啊！真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "7846366dd13ed759a37d8b5f7a7a6e546dac76983ce0aee34eec9248bf6bbc6c", "ja": "はあ！？　マジかよ、なんだってそんな？", "zh": "哈！？真的假的，为什么要这样啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d0e0328ee0145814264ae97e29fdfcb1f1df12e3e9ca493ff195b3702047874c", "ja": "なんか、情報統制したいみたいなんだよね。\n捕まると記憶を操作されるんだって。", "zh": "好像是想要进行信息管制。\n听说一旦被抓住，记忆就会被操纵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1028_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cf49a7709bc8a9f354a07ff4468a8550b9dcbefe0cf8f100bef0a09ad04d7ee3", "ja": "深青書院から、全面的に技術提供を受けてるらしい。\n施設から戻って来た奴、別人みたいになってたってさ。", "zh": "听说深青书院为他们提供了全方位的技术支持。\n据说从设施里回来的人，都变得像换了个人似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "f36ca5ab4e0f99fab25e38315f78ce20d31a5b80aa472632ba9d918de2f88915", "ja": "……っ！　あいつら、またそんなことを……。", "zh": "……！那些家伙，又在做那种事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "59c1f38f26cde2a57d7b8acf84bd156d95682685323694298373b8f0dd0b897e", "ja": "記憶を操作する、なんて……そんなことできるの？\nなんだか、悪い夢でも見てるみたい……", "zh": "操纵记忆什么的……真的能做到这种事吗？总觉得就像做了个噩梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1031_005yay", "source_sha256": "1684467cf9501b901c8e77d14ec755f3a477cd82a251b41eec34f9019407ec5d", "ja": "私たち、どうしたらいいんですかね～……？", "zh": "我们该怎么办才好呢～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0427_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0427_story_02_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6f5404baaddf9c2ab16a78e739fb8142d2e75af8a98fe6aff158c95b53e29fdd", "ja": "今はとりあえず、アタシについてきてよ。\n考える時間くらいは、あげられると思うから。", "zh": "现在总之，先跟着我吧。\n我想，思考的时间还是能给你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
